OL,5,G1730 Red Rock
OL,6,     FRed Rock is a busy Dublin Garda
OL,7,     Fstation just outside of the city.
OL,8,     FTwo prominent families in the
OL,9,     Fneighbourhood are the Hennessys
OL,10,     Fand the Kielys, who have an
OL,11,     Fongoing feud.
OL,12,G1800 Don't Look Back In Anger
OL,13,     FIn a series of 20 half hours, we
OL,14,     Fchronicle the news and highlights
OL,15,     Fof the last 20 years in this
OL,16,     Farchive and music-based series.
